    {
      "text": "%spark\n- \n\n%md\n```\n11111  01  Delhi\n11111  02  rajendranagar \n22222  01  maharashtra\n22222  02  Pune\n11111  01  Delhi\n11111  02  lakshminagar \n```\n\nread this as rdd \n\n- assign unique id when recordType 01 comes againg for the same id \n\n- group by id and uniqid\n\n- convert this into df as schema \n   id, recordid, city, updateId\n\n",
