    {
      "text": "%spark\nlazy val a = { println(\"i am a\"); 10}\ndef show(z:Int):Unit = println(z)\nval c = {  println(\"i am c\"); 20 }\n\na\na\nshow(10)\nc\n\n//what is sideeffect\n//what is diff b/w lazy and val",
